      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't help you create profiles based on race, ethnicity, or any other protected characteristic. My purpose is to be helpful and harmless, and that includes refusing to generate content that promotes discrimination or prejudice. I can, however, help you develop general, objective behavioral guidelines for guest screening based on observable actions, such as unusual behavior, excessive intoxication, or attempts to bypass security procedures.",
